WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.669 --> 00:00:04.255
- [Voiceover] I wonder if I
could just squeeze one out.

00:00:04.255 --> 00:00:05.381
(squeaky fart)

00:00:09.611 --> 00:00:11.169
Did Zack hear that?

00:00:11.839 --> 00:00:13.556
Oh no, he has headphones on.

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:17.635
Good, I'm totally getting away with this.

00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:19.579
Oh, no.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.168
Oh god, it's bad.

00:00:23.858 --> 00:00:26.477
Why did I eat that breakfast burrito?

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:28.904
Maybe if I look like I don't care.

00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:30.658
You know, just working.

00:00:30.658 --> 00:00:32.576
Nothing to see here.

00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:35.161
Maybe if I swivel back and forth

00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:39.957
I'll get the air circulating
and like kind of fan it away.

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:42.502
Okay, it's working.

00:00:42.502 --> 00:00:44.046
The fanning works.

00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:46.372
Now no one will ever know.

00:00:48.863 --> 00:00:51.278
(stomach rumbling)
Oh no, not again.

00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:52.677
(fart)

00:00:55.682 --> 00:00:57.392
(grunting)

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:00.229
- Okay, who did it?

00:01:00.229 --> 00:01:02.638
It smells like garbage in here.

00:01:02.638 --> 00:01:04.182
Come on, just admit it.

00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:06.151
It smells like butt.

00:01:06.151 --> 00:01:07.569
- I know, right?

00:01:07.569 --> 00:01:09.654
Someone's going off here.

00:01:09.654 --> 00:01:12.065
Are you like fanning it
this way or something?

00:01:12.065 --> 00:01:14.986
Because it's like very
concentrated like just right here.

00:01:14.986 --> 00:01:16.651
- Gosh, that is thick.

00:01:16.651 --> 00:01:17.412
- Very rich.

00:01:17.412 --> 00:01:18.669
- That is some thick gas.

